# panel-src phase 8 — owner fix batch (Nov 2026, v1.9.15-dev.1)
#
# 1. REAL HTTP Range serving in /api/media/[...path] (206 + Content-Range
#    + 416) — iPhone Safari requires byte-range support for <audio>;
#    playback there errored out while Android worked.
# 2. Assignment notifications go ONLY to the assigned rep: the admin-side
#    notifyAdmin + the realtime emitEvent('notification') with the
#    REP-FACING text («...به شما اختصاص داده شد») are removed from both
#    /api/assignments and /api/assignments/bulk — the admin (the ACTOR)
#    used to receive a Windows/browser notification phrased as if THEY
#    were the assignee.
# 3. /api/app/customers incremental sync is ASSIGNMENT-AWARE: a change is
#    now Customer.updatedAt > since OR a fresh Assignment.createdAt > since
#    for this employee — an old customer newly assigned finally syncs.
#    serverTime is captured BEFORE the query (race-free watermark for the
#    app, which no longer uses local max(updatedAt)).
# 4. /api/planned-visits window.today — the REAL server-local today (the
#    panel's «امروز» button used window.dayKey, which equals the REQUESTED
#    date, so clicking it did nothing).
# 5. PlansTab: Jalali MONTH CALENDAR (per-day counts, red overdue days,
#    click-to-open) + «همهٔ روزها» view (±۴۵ days, OVERDUE pinned section)
#    + rows carry their Jalali date in that view.
# 6. CustomersTab: per-customer assign/revoke dialog (checkbox list of
#    reps — single-customer counterpart to the existing bulk operations).
# 7. NEW src/lib/jalali.ts — the same jalaali-js algorithms the Android
#    app uses, for the month calendar.
